def nb_chemins(n, m):
    c = [[1] * (m + 1) for _ in range(n + 1)]
    for i in range(1, n + 1):
        for j in range(1, m + 1):
            c[i][j] = c[i - 1][j] + c[i][j - 1]
    return c[n][m]
```
Par exemple nb_chemins(2, 3) renvoie 10.

